---
// Shared by the LinkedIn service page and the homepage.
---

<div class="thought-flow" role="img" aria-label="Founder expertise becomes content buyers remember, then qualified conversations with CRM context">
  <span class="flow-kicker">The connected motion</span>
  <div class="flow-step"><span class="flow-dot">01</span><div><strong>Your expertise</strong><small>Research and founder interviews</small></div></div>
  <span class="flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
  <div class="flow-step"><span class="flow-dot">02</span><div><strong>Content buyers remember</strong><small>Posts, graphics, and useful assets</small></div></div>
  <span class="flow-arrow flow-arrow-result" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
  <div class="flow-step flow-step-result"><span class="flow-dot">03</span><div><strong>Qualified conversations</strong><small>Fit checks, outreach, and CRM context</small></div></div>
</div>

<style>
  .thought-flow { width: 100%; padding: var(--space-6); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-top: 3px solid var(--color-accent); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
  .flow-kicker { display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-5); color: var(--color-accent); font: 700 .72rem var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .flow-step { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-4); padding: var(--space-4); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--color-surface-raised); }
  .flow-step div { min-width: 0; }
  .flow-step strong, .flow-step small { display: block; }
  .flow-step strong { color: var(--color-heading); font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .flow-step small { margin-top: 2px; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: .83rem; }
  .flow-dot { display: grid; flex: 0 0 34px; width: 34px; height: 34px; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-accent); color: #fff; font: 700 .74rem var(--font-mono); }
  .flow-arrow { display: block; padding: 3px 0 3px 31px; color: var(--color-accent); font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1; }
  .flow-arrow-result { color: #72c893; }
  .flow-step-result { border-color: #355343; background: #17251d; }
  .flow-step-result .flow-dot { background: var(--color-positive); }
  .flow-step-result small { color: #a8cbb4; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .thought-flow { padding: var(--space-5); } }
</style>
